      "product_name": "더블트러플 탈모케어 퍼퓸 샴푸",
      "price": 32200,
      "detail_image": "https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg1930b97041247089/eclmoi/web/product/big/20250722/06775ca5213d964f9aca4a7ea6cf33d1.jpg",
